{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The blood-hungry gods rule over a jungle world where gladiatorial combat is their favorite pastime. You are one of the hopeful few, leading your warband into deadly matches, seeking glory and noble title\u2014or to be the next sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends roguelike progression with auto-battler tactical combat. You\u2019ll deploy troops with precision, cast spells in real time, and sacrifice units when needed to earn divine favor. In the Emerald City, you\u2019ll strengthen your army, collect blessings, and develop your own brutal strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras/0fb8e58a95d177a47e7d3e9c85fb5795.avif?t=1765242852\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras_big/0fb8e58a95d177a47e7d3e9c85fb5795.avif?t=1765242852 width=1600 height=576 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your origin and faith\u2014play a barbarian warrior devoted to a god of wild fury, or a ruthless slaver worshipping the lord of the underworld\uff1f\u00a0Your choices shape your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras/61c92d954d9c5c651117e0dd0e8f4cff.avif?t=1765242852\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras_big/61c92d954d9c5c651117e0dd0e8f4cff.webp?t=1765242852 width=1600 height=577 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dark and captivating world filled with slaves, warriors, nobles, the undead, and mythical beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras/a5eee8d849653acc08ccfa28ebe3cb18.avif?t=1765242852\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras_big/a5eee8d849653acc08ccfa28ebe3cb18.avif?t=1765242852 width=1600 height=576 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep unit building! 50+ unique troop types, 30+ distinct spells, and over 100 different blessings to discover and combine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras/d27926af642467413f89d14996227041.avif?t=1765242852\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras_big/d27926af642467413f89d14996227041.avif?t=1765242852 width=1600 height=576 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every drop of blood on the battlefield fuels your magic.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon beasts, unleash devastating spells, or empower your army\u2014take control of the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras/00542d14966963ce39182e8741c6b6a7.avif?t=1765242852\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras_big/00542d14966963ce39182e8741c6b6a7.avif?t=1765242852 width=1600 height=576 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, blood just isn\u2019t enough... Try sacrificing your followers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras/35181491750b44db8b9c52d9b02fa2f2.avif?t=1765242852\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/extras_big/35181491750b44db8b9c52d9b02fa2f2.avif?t=1765242852 width=1600 height=546 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win 36 brutal matches and claim the champion\u2019s title.<br>Will you survive? Will you triumph?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816000?t=1765242852","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/a3be31297da1aae4ffe435b932585c9ed446c6db/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765242852","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/1ee5d94b2173c6abb247b782044e92f40111b0f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765242852","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816000/1ee5d94b2173c6abb247b782044e92f40111b0f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765242852","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4239480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The blood-hungry gods rule over a jungle world where gladiatorial combat is their favorite pastime. You are one of the hopeful few, leading your warband into deadly matches, seeking glory and noble title\u2014or to be the next sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends roguelike progression with auto-battler tactical combat. You\u2019ll deploy troops with precision, cast spells in real time, and sacrifice units when needed to earn divine favor. In the Emerald City, you\u2019ll strengthen your army, collect blessings, and develop your own brutal strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragra